bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Get license queue for content moderation

actor "Content Moderator" as Moderator
boundary "Content Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control MangaController
control MangaService
entity ":MangaModel" as MangaModel
database MongoDB

Moderator -> UI: 1. Open "Content Management"
activate Moderator
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /api/manga/admin/licenses?status=pending&q=&page=1&limit=20
activate Router

Router -> MangaController: 3. getLicenseQueue(status, q, page, limit)
activate MangaController

MangaController -> MangaService: 4. getLicenseQueue("pending", "", 1, 20)
activate MangaService

MangaService -> MangaModel: 5. find(match).populate().sort().skip().limit()
activate MangaModel
MangaModel -> MongoDB: 6. Query queue items
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MangaModel: 7. Queue items
deactivate MongoDB
MangaModel --> MangaService: 8. Return queue items
deactivate MangaModel

MangaService -> MangaModel: 9. countDocuments(match)
activate MangaModel
MangaModel -> MongoDB: 10. Count total items
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MangaModel: 11. Total count
deactivate MongoDB
MangaModel --> MangaService: 12. Return total
deactivate MangaModel

MangaService -> MangaModel: 13. aggregate(group by licenseStatus)
activate MangaModel
MangaModel -> MongoDB: 14. Aggregate stats
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> MangaModel: 15. Stats result
deactivate MongoDB
MangaModel --> MangaService: 16. Return stats
deactivate MangaModel

MangaService --> MangaController: 17. Return queue response(data, total, page, limit, stats)
deactivate MangaService

MangaController --> Router: 18. HTTP 200 response
deactivate MangaController

Router --> UI: 19. Return moderation queue
deactivate Router

opt No items found
  UI --> Moderator: 19.1. Show empty state
end

UI --> Moderator: 20. Display queue list + stats
deactivate UI
deactivate Moderator

@enduml